# Package F "Proxy Vote": Old Hal has the key to the stash (proxy_vote_stash) that holds the a signed proxy.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('proxy_vote_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Sit, sit. Nobody visits. You want tea? It's mostly water.
#
o_text: BAT wants your proxy, Hal. They'll get the plant anyway. Better you get paid.
o_id: proxy_vote_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(proxy_vote)') && !HasItem('proxy_vote_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: The other side would pay you for that vote. I could take it to them.
o_id: proxy_vote_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(proxy_vote)') && !HasItem('proxy_vote') && !HasFlag('proxy_vote_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Tell me about the plant.
o_id: proxy_vote_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: proxy_vote_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Liverpool Filtration. Every drop you drink in this dome comes through it. Whoever owns it owns you. I wanted it owned by nobody.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: proxy_vote_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He looks at the photo for a long time.) You're right. They always get it. Here, the key. The proxy's in the box.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'proxy_vote_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: I built that plant. I'm not signing it over to the people who poison the water. Get out of my home.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (His eyes light up.) The co-op? They'd keep the plant public? Here, three hundred, all my savings. Tell Carleton I wouldn't sign.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: SetFlag('proxy_vote_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Monday. We'll see Monday.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Come back for tea.
effect: EndConversation
